WEBVTT

01:40.300 --> 01:44.229
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.080 --> 01:47.220
[Episode 25]

01:48.200 --> 01:50.200
Can you represent fairness and justice?

01:51.350 --> 01:52.200
I cannot.

01:52.509 --> 01:54.640
But the Six Realms have their own laws and regulations.

01:54.870 --> 01:56.870
Both the human race and the immortal race

01:56.870 --> 01:59.000
have their own laws and rules.

01:59.310 --> 02:01.350
If someone goes against them,

02:01.370 --> 02:03.730
disregarding all life, insisting on turning to the demonic path,

02:03.990 --> 02:05.230
and bringing great harm to the world's harmony,

02:06.810 --> 02:08.520
then heaven's laws will definitely deal with them.

02:09.110 --> 02:11.080
Even if that person has many reasons,

02:11.910 --> 02:13.280
they still must pay the price

02:13.280 --> 02:14.360
for their actions.

02:18.280 --> 02:19.750
Here's your dish, sir.

02:34.590 --> 02:35.470
It tastes good.

02:35.800 --> 02:36.590
Try it.

02:44.520 --> 02:47.120
Bravo! Bravo!

02:57.960 --> 02:58.960
Where are we?

02:59.220 --> 03:00.570
Up ahead is the Years Well.

03:01.630 --> 03:03.360
An old man once told me that

03:03.900 --> 03:05.380
[Years Well]

03:04.030 --> 03:05.240
during the Lantern Festival in Yandu,

03:05.550 --> 03:07.270
many young people come here.

03:07.560 --> 03:08.840
If you pray with sincerity,

03:09.680 --> 03:11.240
you'll catch a glimpse of your future.

03:11.910 --> 03:12.800
I didn't know that Yandu

03:12.800 --> 03:13.730
had such a place.

03:15.030 --> 03:16.230
Let's go and take a look too.

03:21.870 --> 03:22.840
Before praying,

03:23.400 --> 03:24.630
put these three kinds of leaves

03:24.910 --> 03:26.060
into a red cloth strip

03:27.120 --> 03:28.280
and hang it by the well.

03:29.079 --> 03:31.240
Legend has it this brings good luck.

03:33.079 --> 03:36.240
Locust leaf, elm leaf, and willow leaf?

03:36.840 --> 03:37.630
Yes.

03:38.400 --> 03:39.710
The word "locust" sounds like "first."

03:40.400 --> 03:42.680
People always hope that their children

03:43.079 --> 03:44.400
pass the imperial exams

03:44.630 --> 03:45.710
and become officials in the court.

03:46.870 --> 03:48.310
In March, people have fresh elm seeds

03:48.630 --> 03:50.000
steamed with sugar

03:50.120 --> 03:51.800
and call it "elm seed cakes."

03:52.470 --> 03:55.079
Elm trees symbolize favorable weather for crops

03:55.370 --> 03:56.490
and food for the people.

03:58.000 --> 04:00.280
And the word "willow" sounds like "stay,"

04:01.430 --> 04:04.910
carrying the meaning that those in love will not be separated.

04:11.150 --> 04:12.590
It is indeed a good omen.

05:10.290 --> 05:11.530
What did you see?

05:12.020 --> 05:12.820
Nothing.

05:14.870 --> 05:16.230
Maybe I wasn't sincere enough,

05:17.310 --> 05:18.800
so I didn't see anything.

05:23.580 --> 05:24.380
What about you?

05:25.250 --> 05:26.210
What did you see?

05:30.680 --> 05:31.480
I...

05:46.040 --> 05:47.510
I saw your future—

05:48.159 --> 05:49.240
your good days

05:49.870 --> 05:50.750
50, 80,

05:51.510 --> 05:53.480
or even two or three hundred years from now.

05:54.800 --> 05:55.920
By then,

05:57.040 --> 05:58.230
you will have white hair but a youthful face,

05:58.990 --> 06:00.110
surrounded by your children and grandchildren.

06:01.040 --> 06:02.310
You will be full of kindness and ease,

06:02.960 --> 06:04.080
joy and peace.

06:04.830 --> 06:07.920
You will grow old together with one person.

06:08.870 --> 06:10.310
And many others will envy you.

06:11.680 --> 06:12.480
That's all?

06:13.830 --> 06:14.630
In the end,

06:15.660 --> 06:17.060
you will find fulfillment

06:18.160 --> 06:20.390
and live a life that, when you look back on it,

06:20.390 --> 06:22.190
is filled with endless happiness.

06:24.750 --> 06:26.260
But with whom will I

06:27.600 --> 06:28.750
spend a fulfilling life?

07:38.990 --> 07:41.190
The rich fragrance fills the heaven and earth.

07:41.380 --> 07:43.500
This scent reaches the Gate of Heaven.

07:43.820 --> 07:45.900
Crossing a thousand miles, we offer incense in prayer,

07:46.430 --> 07:49.000
hoping for the true god to appear at this altar.

07:50.270 --> 07:51.070
Oh god,

07:51.220 --> 07:53.540
I am your most faithful servant.

07:53.560 --> 07:55.800
I have an important matter to report to you.

07:56.070 --> 07:58.830
I have an important matter to report to you!

08:30.980 --> 08:32.970
You are truly useless.

08:36.210 --> 08:37.210
Goddess, please forgive us.

08:37.370 --> 08:38.770
It was all my fault.

08:39.120 --> 08:40.510
Goddess, please help me

08:40.929 --> 08:42.770
and give me another chance.

08:46.150 --> 08:48.480
Haven't I given you enough chances?

08:51.750 --> 08:53.510
Give me one last chance.

08:54.080 --> 08:55.360
Either Yuanzhong dies,

08:56.870 --> 08:57.670
or,

08:58.120 --> 08:58.910
I die.

10:28.840 --> 10:30.150
If you War Demons

10:30.150 --> 10:32.200
want to become perfect War Demons,

10:32.790 --> 10:34.030
you must understand

10:34.030 --> 10:35.720
the true meaning of life and death

10:35.840 --> 10:37.870
through countless fierce battles.

10:38.120 --> 10:39.600
Break down and then rebuild;

10:39.630 --> 10:41.120
accumulate thoroughly, then release gradually.

10:41.200 --> 10:42.870
Only then can you be reborn from the fire

10:43.030 --> 10:45.180
and awaken the power in your bloodline.

10:45.450 --> 10:47.660
This combat power is no different from divine power.

10:47.720 --> 10:49.030
And it was the very foundation upon which

10:49.050 --> 10:51.560
your ancestors once stood in the Divine Realm.

10:52.080 --> 10:53.790
My concerns for my clan

10:54.420 --> 10:56.020
have led to many distractions,

10:56.880 --> 10:58.200
preventing me from comprehending

10:58.200 --> 10:59.440
the final level.

10:59.570 --> 11:00.960
This Picture of Hundred Ghosts

11:01.440 --> 11:03.480
can help you

11:03.480 --> 11:05.020
quickly achieve perfection.

11:05.150 --> 11:06.020
While it's not as powerful

11:06.040 --> 11:07.960
as a truly perfect War Demon,

11:07.960 --> 11:09.790
there are enough of you,

11:10.160 --> 11:11.670
so that should be enough to deal with him.

11:11.700 --> 11:12.950
That's it?

11:14.440 --> 11:15.240
No.

11:15.670 --> 11:16.870
You still need to open the gate

11:16.870 --> 11:18.570
of the Picture of Hundred Ghosts.

11:54.390 --> 11:55.390
Follow me.

11:55.750 --> 11:57.550
Bring in the corpse of Granny Gu.

12:41.330 --> 12:42.400
You came here late at night.

12:42.890 --> 12:43.730
For what?

12:43.840 --> 12:45.120
You haven't answered the question

12:45.140 --> 12:46.260
I asked you today.

12:46.480 --> 12:47.440
Haven't you already seen

12:47.440 --> 12:48.510
my future?

12:48.920 --> 12:49.990
Why are you still asking me?

12:50.030 --> 12:51.150
When we were at Gushan,

12:51.240 --> 12:51.910
I didn't enter

12:51.910 --> 12:53.270
your ninth layer of dreams.

12:53.750 --> 12:55.150
What exactly is in there?

12:55.150 --> 12:56.200
You want to know,

12:56.550 --> 12:57.960
so I have to tell you?

12:57.960 --> 12:58.960
If you don't tell me,

12:59.070 --> 13:00.400
I'll just have to see it for myself.

13:12.770 --> 13:15.010
Why is it different here from before?

13:20.240 --> 13:21.720
You're really ridiculous.

13:26.440 --> 13:28.150
I just wanted to confirm something.

13:28.360 --> 13:29.960
Are you trying to confirm whether I'm a good person?

13:30.360 --> 13:31.120
Or whether I can live out my days

13:31.120 --> 13:32.790
as a kind old man?

13:33.340 --> 13:34.340
What if I'm not?

13:34.660 --> 13:35.900
Are you going to kill me?

13:36.030 --> 13:37.240
Don't say that.

13:37.240 --> 13:38.000
Don't?

13:38.320 --> 13:39.360
It's because you haven't seen

13:39.360 --> 13:40.630
a reason to act yet, right?

13:40.630 --> 13:41.840
I believe what I see

13:41.840 --> 13:42.840
with my own eyes.

13:42.840 --> 13:43.550
So,

13:43.600 --> 13:44.890
please let me take a look.

13:45.270 --> 13:46.270
What if I don't?

13:47.790 --> 13:48.440
That means

13:48.440 --> 13:49.750
you're hiding something from me.

13:49.920 --> 13:50.710
Hiding something from you?

13:53.290 --> 13:54.900
How ridiculous, Ji Tanyin.

13:56.600 --> 13:58.240
Don't you have anything you're hiding from me?

13:58.960 --> 13:59.840
I've already felt the presence

13:59.840 --> 14:01.080
of that dragon.

14:01.080 --> 14:01.790
So today,

14:01.790 --> 14:02.720
I must enter your

14:02.720 --> 14:04.160
ninth layer of dreams to take a look.

14:04.190 --> 14:05.670
That's not up to you.

14:13.830 --> 14:15.040
At the Years Well,

14:16.060 --> 14:16.870
you said I would

14:16.870 --> 14:18.550
grow old with one person.

14:19.670 --> 14:20.790
Who is that?

14:22.340 --> 14:23.580
Who am I going to

14:24.910 --> 14:26.200
have many children and grandchildren with?

14:27.790 --> 14:29.320
I've told you before, Yuanzhong.

14:29.320 --> 14:30.480
Told me what?

14:30.510 --> 14:31.720
Your third rule?

14:31.940 --> 14:32.650
Absolutely not

14:32.680 --> 14:33.690
to fall in love with you?

14:33.720 --> 14:34.870
I have my reasons.

14:34.870 --> 14:36.840
Then tell me your reasons!

14:45.030 --> 14:45.840
Ji Tanyin,

14:47.440 --> 14:49.360
you told me to live a carefree life.

14:52.270 --> 14:53.120
Let me ask you.

14:53.880 --> 14:56.020
♫Time never defeats the fleeting world♫

14:54.070 --> 14:55.760
I'll ask you one last time.

14:56.900 --> 15:00.690
♫Stars turn, shining upon the passing traveler♫

14:57.780 --> 14:59.420
Where do you want me to go?

15:00.120 --> 15:01.640
What kind of life do you want me to live?

15:01.210 --> 15:03.910
♫The wind rises, flowers fall and bloom again♫

15:03.290 --> 15:04.570
And who do you want me to spend it with?

15:04.600 --> 15:07.950
♫Awaiting what's lost to be regained♫

15:08.320 --> 15:10.530
This is the last time I'm asking you.

15:08.500 --> 15:10.780
♫These countless sorrows and joys♫

15:11.490 --> 15:14.900
♫Dusk and dawn, only you make parting hard♫

15:12.800 --> 15:15.480
You still won't tell me anything?

15:15.850 --> 15:21.370
♫I'm willing to risk my life for this♫

15:23.020 --> 15:26.010
♫Wind chimes beat with my heart♫

15:26.360 --> 15:29.390
♫Harmonizing, can you recognize it?♫

15:29.950 --> 15:32.850
♫Fingertips tracing your outline♫

15:33.480 --> 15:34.630
Fine.

15:33.530 --> 15:36.780
♫I wish to see through you♫

15:37.240 --> 15:38.670
Don't say anything from now on.

15:37.540 --> 15:40.260
♫Whether near or far♫

15:40.630 --> 15:42.320
I don't want to hear it anymore.

15:40.780 --> 15:45.440
♫We can still gaze upon the same galaxy♫

15:45.820 --> 15:51.680
♫Knowing we've never been apart for a moment♫

15:50.670 --> 15:51.840
Yuanzhong, what's wrong with you?

15:52.200 --> 15:53.240
What are you going to do?

15:52.240 --> 15:55.110
♫If our promise♫

15:53.240 --> 15:54.200
Even you think

15:54.200 --> 15:55.240
I'll definitely do something,

15:55.130 --> 15:58.310
♫Is to share this land and rivers♫

15:55.240 --> 15:56.000
don't you?

15:58.270 --> 16:00.080
Don't look at me

15:59.230 --> 16:02.200
♫If fate leads us astray♫

16:00.080 --> 16:01.030
like that.

16:02.120 --> 16:03.750
What do you think I'm going to do?

16:02.480 --> 16:06.160
♫Life and death become our bond♫

16:04.390 --> 16:06.360
What do you think I can do?

16:06.640 --> 16:09.360
♫Storms heal with time♫

16:08.600 --> 16:09.630
In your heart,

16:09.630 --> 16:11.840
you've already sentenced me.

16:09.990 --> 16:14.390
♫Memories will shine in the end♫

16:11.840 --> 16:13.870
Why are you pretending

16:13.870 --> 16:15.270
to be surprised?

16:14.890 --> 16:20.520
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

16:15.390 --> 16:16.360
I didn't.

16:18.670 --> 16:19.790
You didn't?

16:20.120 --> 16:21.320
You're not?

16:21.510 --> 16:23.600
You never have?

16:24.360 --> 16:25.200
Ji Tanyin,

16:25.840 --> 16:28.550
when will you be honest for once?

16:35.070 --> 16:36.670
Open your eyes and take a look.

16:38.050 --> 16:39.810
Look at this ugly world.

16:40.360 --> 16:41.670
It's full of endless resentment,

16:41.670 --> 16:42.790
complete with hatred.

16:42.790 --> 16:43.960
No one is exempt.

16:43.960 --> 16:45.630
Why can't I be the same?

16:45.720 --> 16:46.800
Why do I have to forgive

16:46.820 --> 16:48.270
all of this magnanimously?

16:48.270 --> 16:49.320
Why?

16:49.480 --> 16:51.200
I'm not forcing you to forgive.

16:50.330 --> 16:53.130
♫Wind chimes beat with my heart♫

16:52.440 --> 16:53.790
Then what are you doing?

16:53.560 --> 16:57.270
♫Harmonizing, can you recognize it?♫

16:54.050 --> 16:55.840
You keep saying you're not forcing me,

16:55.870 --> 16:57.440
keep saying you don't doubt me.

16:57.440 --> 16:58.840
Then why did you enter my sea of consciousness?

16:57.470 --> 17:00.310
♫Fingertips tracing your outline♫

16:58.840 --> 17:00.200
Just to enjoy the wind?

17:00.800 --> 17:03.830
♫I wish to see through you♫

17:04.810 --> 17:07.710
♫Whether near or far♫

17:07.750 --> 17:08.560
Go ahead.

17:07.960 --> 17:12.730
♫We can still gaze upon the same galaxy♫

17:10.270 --> 17:12.589
Enjoy this whispering wind.

17:13.030 --> 17:19.230
♫Knowing we've never been apart for a moment♫

17:13.510 --> 17:14.310
Listen.

17:14.880 --> 17:16.200
The wind is speaking.

17:17.400 --> 17:19.960
Yuanzhong, you must be strong.

17:19.480 --> 17:22.349
♫If our promise♫

17:20.069 --> 17:21.480
Yuanzhong, you must become a god!

17:21.480 --> 17:23.109
Yuanzhong, you must be free of hatred!

17:22.380 --> 17:25.960
♫Is to share this land and rivers♫

17:23.109 --> 17:25.200
Yuanzhong, you must repay hatred with kindness!

17:25.200 --> 17:27.000
Listen! Did you hear that?

17:26.599 --> 17:29.290
♫If fate leads us astray♫

17:27.349 --> 17:28.680
Don't be like this, Yuanzhong.

17:28.680 --> 17:29.830
I've already

17:29.350 --> 17:33.530
♫Life and death become our bond♫

17:29.830 --> 17:31.070
heard enough of this nonsense!

17:31.070 --> 17:31.680
I'm sick of it!

17:31.680 --> 17:33.270
I'm completely fed up with it!

17:33.960 --> 17:34.590
Ji Tanyin,

17:34.010 --> 17:36.730
♫Storms heal with time♫

17:34.590 --> 17:36.880
I've been stuffed full of these words.

17:36.880 --> 17:38.880
I can't take it in anymore.

17:36.880 --> 17:41.540
♫Memories will shine in the end♫

17:39.200 --> 17:41.110
I'm already at my limit.

17:41.110 --> 17:42.920
I'm about to explode!

17:42.170 --> 17:47.830
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

17:42.960 --> 17:44.510
I know you have resentment.

17:44.550 --> 17:45.880
But please believe me.

17:46.160 --> 17:47.070
Heaven will treat

17:47.070 --> 17:48.200
everyone fairly.

17:48.200 --> 17:50.550
The wicked will surely be repaid with retribution.

17:49.350 --> 17:55.550
♫When we hold hands, we fear no hardship♫

17:52.750 --> 17:54.440
Then how do you know

17:56.200 --> 17:58.880
I'm not their retribution?

17:56.810 --> 18:02.760
♫When we are devoted to each other, we fear not separation♫

18:03.890 --> 18:06.120
♫If there's no turning back♫

18:06.210 --> 18:10.880
♫And no chance to meet again, then this moment alone is enough♫

18:11.060 --> 18:13.040
♫At least we have once touched♫

18:13.350 --> 18:19.130
♫A corner of eternity♫

18:21.250 --> 18:24.280
♫If our promise♫

18:21.700 --> 18:22.500
Yuanzhong,

18:24.310 --> 18:27.490
♫Is to share this land and rivers♫

18:24.880 --> 18:26.070
ask yourself.

18:27.960 --> 18:29.720
In all the years you've been in this world,

18:28.360 --> 18:31.580
♫If fate leads us astray♫

18:30.550 --> 18:32.680
besides hypocrisy, betrayal,

18:31.610 --> 18:35.280
♫Life and death become our bond♫

18:32.680 --> 18:34.000
coldness, and obsession,

18:34.510 --> 18:35.270
haven't you ever felt

18:35.270 --> 18:36.830
even the slightest bit of beauty?

18:35.500 --> 18:38.730
♫Storms heal with time♫

18:37.720 --> 18:38.960
Is this world really not worth

18:38.850 --> 18:43.710
♫Memories will shine in the end♫

18:38.960 --> 18:40.680
even the slightest bit of your attachment?

18:43.860 --> 18:49.210
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

18:44.720 --> 18:46.310
Do you really understand?

18:46.790 --> 18:47.590
I think

18:48.310 --> 18:49.400
the one who doesn't understand

18:49.850 --> 18:50.770
is you.

18:51.230 --> 18:52.840
I understand that I must stop you.

18:51.350 --> 18:58.140
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

18:59.350 --> 19:00.160
Ji Tanyin,

19:02.070 --> 19:03.960
in which identity

19:04.630 --> 19:05.670
and stance

19:06.510 --> 19:07.510
are you stopping me now?

19:18.110 --> 19:19.680
I will always be with you.

19:21.010 --> 19:22.940
I really will always be with you.

19:30.960 --> 19:31.750
Looks like

19:32.750 --> 19:34.000
the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain

19:34.680 --> 19:36.480
is going to save the world again.

19:37.270 --> 19:38.070
No.

19:45.720 --> 19:47.160
I've told you, Yuanzhong,

19:48.680 --> 19:50.070
that if reasoning doesn't work,

19:50.270 --> 19:50.920
I'll use

19:50.920 --> 19:52.310
my own methods.

19:52.310 --> 19:53.000
Alright.

19:54.310 --> 19:55.240
Ji Tanyin.

19:57.110 --> 19:58.550
Bring it on.

20:35.400 --> 20:36.200
Qian Lin?

20:37.160 --> 20:38.360
Qian Lin, Qian Lin!

20:38.790 --> 20:39.480
Look.

20:39.960 --> 20:41.110
Does it look nice?

20:41.110 --> 20:42.310
A rabbit-shaped one.

20:46.480 --> 20:48.640
Why are you always so quiet?

20:48.680 --> 20:49.890
Let's chat.

20:49.920 --> 20:51.240
It's so lively today.

20:54.750 --> 20:55.880
Last time, you said

20:56.240 --> 20:58.720
your home is in a place far to the north.

20:58.720 --> 21:00.110
Where exactly is that?

21:00.350 --> 21:02.960
It's just a very distant place.

21:05.240 --> 21:06.310
Is it cold there?

21:08.720 --> 21:09.510
Yes.

21:11.270 --> 21:12.720
Is it lively there?

21:12.720 --> 21:14.270
Any festivals?

21:14.270 --> 21:15.400
Do you have Lantern Festivals?

21:16.510 --> 21:17.310
We don't do that.

21:20.030 --> 21:21.590
What's the point of celebrating this festival?

21:22.400 --> 21:23.920
How could it be pointless?

21:24.030 --> 21:24.680
We humans

21:24.680 --> 21:26.030
often celebrate the Lantern Festival.

21:26.030 --> 21:27.000
So many times

21:27.270 --> 21:28.440
that the organizers are tired of it,

21:28.440 --> 21:29.660
and the people who watch it are tired of it too.

21:29.880 --> 21:31.170
But it still keeps going on.

21:31.440 --> 21:33.200
Because it carries

21:33.200 --> 21:34.920
a lot of our beautiful hopes.

21:34.920 --> 21:36.590
We hope for harmony, peace,

21:36.680 --> 21:38.680
and good fortune throughout the year.

21:38.800 --> 21:39.890
We pray for the blessings

21:39.920 --> 21:41.550
of the gods in heaven.

21:43.590 --> 21:44.960
What's the point of all these

21:45.960 --> 21:46.750
hopes

21:48.030 --> 21:49.110
and prayers of yours?

21:52.640 --> 21:54.640
You work hard from dawn to dusk,

21:55.000 --> 21:56.640
or else you won't even get three meals a day.

21:57.110 --> 21:57.870
When you're injured or sick,

21:57.900 --> 21:59.340
you have to seek out doctors and medicine.

22:00.160 --> 22:01.510
Your lives are filled with busyness,

22:01.840 --> 22:03.560
but before long, you grow old,

22:03.640 --> 22:05.200
reaching the end of your lives.

22:05.720 --> 22:07.480
Do these prayers to the gods really help?

22:09.120 --> 22:10.360
Do the gods help you?

22:11.880 --> 22:13.480
You're such a killjoy.

22:15.200 --> 22:16.000
Fine.

22:16.310 --> 22:17.160
I admit.

22:17.480 --> 22:18.880
You have a point.

22:19.030 --> 22:19.880
Praying to the gods

22:19.880 --> 22:20.920
doesn't have any real effect.

22:21.240 --> 22:22.110
But it gives us

22:22.110 --> 22:23.720
inner strength.

22:24.350 --> 22:26.920
It's like a light

22:27.400 --> 22:28.510
far in the distance.

22:28.720 --> 22:29.510
That light

22:29.830 --> 22:31.550
is the hope of the human race.

22:31.750 --> 22:33.070
At least it lets us know

22:33.190 --> 22:34.640
where we should go.

22:39.070 --> 22:40.960
So many lanterns! They're so beautiful!

22:41.350 --> 22:41.930
Let's go.

22:43.480 --> 22:44.310
Come on, let's go.

22:45.160 --> 22:45.960
Let's take a look.

22:46.440 --> 22:47.240
Look.

22:48.550 --> 22:49.960
How beautiful they are!

22:51.070 --> 22:51.790
That one is just like mine.

22:51.790 --> 22:52.960
The rabbit shape.

22:54.440 --> 22:55.920
There's also one in goldfish shape.

22:56.830 --> 22:58.550
See? I told you they're beautiful.

23:09.200 --> 23:11.270
Tanyin, what's wrong?

23:17.160 --> 23:19.130
Tanyin, what's going on with you?

23:19.160 --> 23:20.400
Why are you crying?

23:23.110 --> 23:24.400
Did someone bully you?

23:24.790 --> 23:27.000
Or did the High Priest scold you?

23:31.920 --> 23:33.350
I guess that's it.

23:33.590 --> 23:35.790
Well, as a handmaiden,

23:35.790 --> 23:37.510
it's unavoidable to face some hardships.

23:37.750 --> 23:39.550
It was the same for me when I was on the tower ship.

23:39.960 --> 23:42.000
But I don't think the High Priest

23:42.160 --> 23:44.880
is the type of person who scolds others

23:44.900 --> 23:46.730
without reason.

23:50.100 --> 23:51.820
I think I did something wrong.

23:53.170 --> 23:54.780
Well, just fix it.

23:55.310 --> 23:56.310
It can't be fixed.

23:57.790 --> 23:58.680
Why?

24:00.000 --> 24:01.640
Because we're not on the same path.

24:02.750 --> 24:04.400
Then why don't you take another path?

24:05.960 --> 24:07.310
But I can't bring myself to do it.

24:09.350 --> 24:10.160
Tanyin.

24:10.240 --> 24:11.000
Alright, Tanyin.

24:11.000 --> 24:11.920
Don't cry.

24:12.250 --> 24:13.310
I don't understand

24:13.310 --> 24:14.550
what path you're talking about.

24:14.550 --> 24:15.640
But since they are paths,

24:15.780 --> 24:16.740
if we take the wrong one,

24:16.760 --> 24:18.280
we can always change to another, right?

24:18.920 --> 24:19.920
Even if, hypothetically,

24:19.960 --> 24:21.040
we can no longer

24:21.070 --> 24:22.270
walk a different path,

24:22.270 --> 24:23.000
can't we just

24:23.310 --> 24:24.240
treat the path we're on

24:24.240 --> 24:25.000
as part of

24:25.000 --> 24:25.830
our journey?

24:26.510 --> 24:28.200
Anyway, on the path you took,

24:28.200 --> 24:29.960
there must be moments of joy

24:29.980 --> 24:31.020
and times when you felt it was the right one,

24:31.640 --> 24:32.430
right?

24:34.950 --> 24:35.910
Anyway, Tanyin,

24:36.000 --> 24:37.650
stop being so sad.

24:37.680 --> 24:39.520
I feel really bad seeing you cry.

24:39.740 --> 24:40.680
How about you sit here,

24:40.680 --> 24:41.200
and I'll go to the kitchen

24:41.200 --> 24:42.350
to make you something delicious?

24:42.350 --> 24:42.750
Once you're full,

24:42.750 --> 24:44.070
you won't be so sad.

24:48.170 --> 24:49.890
What are you doing here?

24:52.640 --> 24:53.440
Nothing.

24:54.350 --> 24:55.310
Tanyin is feeling down.

24:55.310 --> 24:56.000
Go inside

24:56.000 --> 24:56.960
and help me take care of her.

24:59.400 --> 25:00.590
Hurry up.

25:00.590 --> 25:02.160
Don't leave her alone.

25:04.350 --> 25:06.200
Go.

25:07.160 --> 25:07.960
Go!

25:24.110 --> 25:25.070
Get some sleep.

25:29.080 --> 25:30.030
I can't fall asleep.

25:31.920 --> 25:32.880
Because of Yuanzhong?

25:36.280 --> 25:37.840
You've already confirmed something, right?

25:38.680 --> 25:39.750
What did you see?

25:42.440 --> 25:43.720
You should have guessed it.

25:44.960 --> 25:45.960
I haven't.

25:46.330 --> 25:47.640
The High Priest of the Youhu Clan

25:47.880 --> 25:49.510
is more multifaceted than expected.

25:52.880 --> 25:54.440
I really didn't expect it.

25:57.200 --> 25:58.590
I must find a way.

26:00.140 --> 26:01.900
I will definitely come up with a solution.

26:08.750 --> 26:09.550
Ji Tanyin,

26:11.440 --> 26:12.720
the children of the War Demons

26:12.940 --> 26:14.210
were taught from a young age

26:14.230 --> 26:15.470
to not fear death.

26:16.160 --> 26:16.920
But when they hear the words

26:16.920 --> 26:18.310
"High Priest,"

26:18.680 --> 26:20.160
they can't help but shiver.

26:22.030 --> 26:23.480
Do you know why?

26:24.960 --> 26:25.790
Why?

26:26.160 --> 26:27.270
In our clan, there's a legend

26:28.030 --> 26:31.320
that says he is a monster

26:31.750 --> 26:33.030
who can hear a thousand miles away, see a hundred yards,

26:33.480 --> 26:35.590
has a green face and sharp fangs, devours hearts and eats people,

26:35.790 --> 26:37.680
and moves like a ghost.

26:38.510 --> 26:39.640
And that he is the devil who leads the Youhu Clan

26:39.640 --> 26:41.920
in frequently invading our clan.

26:45.240 --> 26:46.920
When we were kids, we all believed it.

26:48.830 --> 26:50.590
But when I actually saw Yuanzhong,

26:50.880 --> 26:51.750
I felt that,

26:54.270 --> 26:55.590
on one hand, he resembled the legend,

26:56.200 --> 26:57.720
and on the other hand, he didn't.

26:58.640 --> 26:59.440
What do you mean?

27:02.000 --> 27:03.350
He's a solitary person

27:03.480 --> 27:04.510
with a weird temper

27:05.400 --> 27:07.070
and shows no mercy when killing our people.

27:07.750 --> 27:09.720
Isn't this the behavior of a monster?

27:10.000 --> 27:11.510
That's on the battlefield.

27:11.640 --> 27:12.440
Yes.

27:13.350 --> 27:15.110
The War Demons fear his divine power.

27:15.720 --> 27:16.550
But we didn't expect

27:16.750 --> 27:17.880
that the Youhu Clan and the human race

27:17.880 --> 27:19.830
also see him as a great threat.

27:20.310 --> 27:21.680
He's the one leading

27:21.680 --> 27:23.070
and protecting the Youhu Clan.

27:23.440 --> 27:24.830
But the Youhu Clan is suspicious of him

27:24.830 --> 27:26.000
and even resents him.

27:28.160 --> 27:28.920
Though we don't know

27:28.920 --> 27:30.400
where this resentment comes from.

27:30.920 --> 27:31.550
I really don't know

27:31.550 --> 27:33.200
if this is Yuanzhong's karma.

27:33.920 --> 27:34.640
He is a hero of both the human race

27:34.640 --> 27:36.160
and the Youhu Clan.

27:37.070 --> 27:37.880
Yet, he has not received

27:37.880 --> 27:40.400
the glory and admiration that heroes deserve.

27:40.750 --> 27:42.110
Instead, he is constantly restricted

27:42.130 --> 27:43.240
and subjected to harm.

27:46.200 --> 27:47.480
If it were me in his place,

27:48.420 --> 27:49.390
I would go mad too.

27:49.590 --> 27:51.200
He's not just being suspected

27:51.200 --> 27:52.830
and having his actions restricted.

27:52.850 --> 27:54.110
What he's gone through

27:54.270 --> 27:55.750
is a hundred times worse than that.

27:59.720 --> 28:01.270
What exactly are you trying to say?

28:02.920 --> 28:04.200
I just want to tell you

28:04.330 --> 28:05.720
that he has his own karma.

28:06.030 --> 28:07.030
His world

28:07.050 --> 28:08.220
is already in ruins.

28:09.030 --> 28:10.400
Those who are abandoned by the heavenly way

28:10.400 --> 28:11.480
do not believe in it.

28:12.180 --> 28:13.220
Whatever he wants to do,

28:13.510 --> 28:14.640
you alone

28:14.640 --> 28:15.730
cannot stop him.

28:16.170 --> 28:17.730
Since you can't change anything,

28:17.810 --> 28:19.330
don't dwell on it too much

28:19.480 --> 28:20.750
and suffer for nothing.

28:24.160 --> 28:25.270
It's not that easy.

28:26.090 --> 28:26.850
Yes, but...

28:26.870 --> 28:27.590
Alright.

28:28.110 --> 28:29.000
I'm tired.

28:29.330 --> 28:30.960
I want to be alone for a while.

28:34.920 --> 28:36.160
Well, get some rest.

29:51.560 --> 29:53.200
Mr. Jin, Mrs. Jin, congratulations

29:53.200 --> 29:54.200
on your son's birth.

29:54.220 --> 29:56.060
The Young Master really looks cheerful.

29:56.550 --> 29:57.750
You're a sensible one.

29:57.750 --> 29:58.750
Leave us and collect your reward.

29:58.750 --> 29:59.350
Remember,

29:59.350 --> 30:00.790
don't say anything you shouldn't.

30:00.790 --> 30:01.390
Yes.

30:04.110 --> 30:05.920
Look, this child is so easy to manage.

30:06.910 --> 30:08.100
You can't eat this.

30:08.590 --> 30:10.240
Go to the private kitchen and get some pastries.

30:10.790 --> 30:11.920
-Anyway,
-Yes.

30:12.030 --> 30:13.810
we now finally have an heir in the family.

30:14.000 --> 30:14.750
I'll see who dares

30:14.750 --> 30:16.440
gossip behind our backs in the future.

30:16.830 --> 30:17.640
Indeed.

30:18.200 --> 30:19.590
Our ancestors are blessing us

30:19.610 --> 30:20.720
by having us buy—

30:21.530 --> 30:22.440
give birth

30:22.640 --> 30:24.750
to such a good boy.

30:25.160 --> 30:26.000
We'll hold a banquet tomorrow.

30:26.070 --> 30:27.240
Inform the family elders

30:27.240 --> 30:28.680
and the nephews from all branches.

30:28.830 --> 30:29.830
Let's gather together.

30:31.480 --> 30:33.070
Hubby, how could you not understand it?

30:33.240 --> 30:34.160
Didn't the second son

30:34.160 --> 30:35.270
of the Wang family say?

30:35.350 --> 30:36.240
This child's parents

30:36.240 --> 30:37.510
aren't locals.

30:37.880 --> 30:38.960
Let's wait a few more days.

30:39.000 --> 30:40.000
It won't be too late to hold the banquet

30:40.000 --> 30:41.590
after they leave the town.

30:42.830 --> 30:44.440
You are more thoughtful than i am.

30:44.460 --> 30:45.740
I got carried away with my excitement

30:45.790 --> 30:46.480
and lost my rationality.

30:47.720 --> 30:48.850
What's important now

30:48.920 --> 30:50.750
is to give our son a name.

30:50.830 --> 30:52.110
What should we call him?

30:54.510 --> 30:55.750
Hubby, look.

30:56.000 --> 30:57.720
The other day, on the street, this child

30:57.750 --> 30:59.440
wanted Beanie's longevity lock.

30:59.550 --> 31:00.240
And now,

31:00.240 --> 31:01.720
he's taken a liking to my gold necklace.

31:01.720 --> 31:02.590
This child

31:02.590 --> 31:04.030
is definitely one of our Jin family.

31:04.030 --> 31:05.030
He recognizes gold.

31:05.030 --> 31:05.790
Here.

31:05.790 --> 31:06.750
Take it.

31:06.750 --> 31:07.790
I'll give you

31:07.790 --> 31:08.960
whatever you like.

31:12.240 --> 31:12.900
Here.

31:21.640 --> 31:23.030
Why are you still awake so late?

31:25.160 --> 31:25.960
I can't sleep.

31:29.750 --> 31:31.440
Who stripped your magic source?

31:34.240 --> 31:34.890
Our chief.

31:35.680 --> 31:36.380
Why?

31:37.990 --> 31:39.070
I offended her.

31:39.550 --> 31:40.550
Just because you offended her,

31:40.570 --> 31:42.180
you received such a severe punishment?

31:45.550 --> 31:47.030
Do you understand the War Demons?

31:47.720 --> 31:48.640
I only know that

31:48.640 --> 31:50.640
the War Demons used to belong to the divine race.

31:52.160 --> 31:53.840
But that was thousands of years ago.

31:54.160 --> 31:54.960
Later,

31:55.310 --> 31:56.640
someone in our clan made a mistake,

31:57.160 --> 31:58.790
and the whole clan was punished and sent to the mortal realm.

31:59.160 --> 32:00.880
The heroes in our clan were determined

32:01.200 --> 32:02.200
to make military merits in the war

32:02.200 --> 32:03.110
between gods and demons

32:03.110 --> 32:04.480
so that we could rejoin the divine race.

32:04.750 --> 32:05.880
So, in that war,

32:05.880 --> 32:06.920
they were especially brave.

32:07.550 --> 32:08.350
Unexpectedly,

32:09.640 --> 32:11.550
the sacrifice of our clan members was extremely heavy.

32:12.680 --> 32:13.550
But after that,

32:13.550 --> 32:15.200
you did not receive any official titles.

32:16.350 --> 32:17.350
The divine race did not fulfill

32:17.350 --> 32:18.480
their promises made before the war.

32:19.270 --> 32:20.110
The celestial ladder was broken.

32:20.720 --> 32:21.510
And we lost contact

32:21.510 --> 32:22.750
with the gods.

32:23.720 --> 32:24.720
In desperation,

32:25.030 --> 32:26.200
the War Demons had no choice

32:26.200 --> 32:27.200
but to stay in the Mortal Realm.

32:28.070 --> 32:29.070
For survival,

32:29.510 --> 32:30.440
we frequently clashed

32:30.440 --> 32:31.400
with the human race and the Youhu Clan,

32:31.430 --> 32:33.030
who had lived and multiplied in the Mortal Realm for generations.

32:36.000 --> 32:36.790
That's why

32:37.750 --> 32:39.440
the Battle of Pinghu broke out?

32:41.610 --> 32:42.260
Yes.

32:43.360 --> 32:44.440
In the Battle of Pinghu,

32:45.930 --> 32:47.160
the War Demons were suppressed by the High Priest's

32:47.160 --> 32:48.240
divine power.

32:48.590 --> 32:50.440
During the two major wars within a thousand years,

32:50.680 --> 32:52.310
nearly 90% of the War Demons' young men

32:52.310 --> 32:53.790
died on the battlefield.

32:54.240 --> 32:55.110
This crisis of annihilation

32:55.110 --> 32:56.510
continued until now.

32:57.160 --> 32:58.640
The War Demons gradually faded into

32:59.070 --> 32:59.880
hiding in

32:59.880 --> 33:01.240
the isolated hidden towns.

33:01.480 --> 33:02.640
The resources available for survival

33:02.640 --> 33:03.750
are simply too few.

33:04.110 --> 33:06.000
Even having offspring has become a problem.

33:06.790 --> 33:08.480
In order to have more children,

33:08.840 --> 33:10.670
the clan began to implement a system of fluid marriages.

33:12.640 --> 33:14.120
What is the fluid marriage system?

33:18.110 --> 33:19.250
All adult men and women

33:19.610 --> 33:21.280
are matched by the Chief.

33:21.510 --> 33:22.510
If they fail to have children

33:22.540 --> 33:23.810
within two years of marriage,

33:23.880 --> 33:25.180
they will be forcibly separated

33:25.310 --> 33:26.300
and paired with someone else.

33:28.110 --> 33:29.240
After having one child,

33:29.510 --> 33:30.240
if they fail to conceive again

33:30.240 --> 33:32.110
within three years,

33:32.750 --> 33:33.880
they will also be separated.

33:35.880 --> 33:36.790
Doesn't this rule

33:37.200 --> 33:38.160
treat all the women

33:38.160 --> 33:38.920
among the War Demons

33:38.920 --> 33:40.510
as mere breeding tools?

33:40.720 --> 33:41.510
Yes.

33:42.790 --> 33:43.790
They have to be breeding tools

33:43.790 --> 33:45.350
that can endure the pain of separation

33:45.350 --> 33:46.400
from their flesh and blood.

33:46.830 --> 33:47.510
Then you...

33:47.510 --> 33:49.270
My mother was such a woman.

33:51.920 --> 33:53.110
My father fell seriously ill.

33:53.350 --> 33:55.440
In order to let him see her one more time

33:55.440 --> 33:56.590
before he died,

33:56.750 --> 33:58.200
I had to go to one hidden town after another

33:58.310 --> 33:59.960
to search for her.

34:01.110 --> 34:02.310
Did you find her?

34:04.550 --> 34:05.720
I guess you could say I found her.

34:06.310 --> 34:07.400
But to let them meet,

34:08.070 --> 34:09.110
to take her away,

34:10.150 --> 34:11.550
I needed a merit.

34:13.030 --> 34:14.150
So, all those times

34:14.230 --> 34:15.840
you tried to assassinate Yuanzhong

34:15.920 --> 34:17.230
were to gain merit?

34:22.840 --> 34:24.400
You almost succeeded.

34:26.760 --> 34:27.550
But,

34:29.030 --> 34:30.000
before I could see my mother,

34:30.000 --> 34:31.030
she died.

34:32.110 --> 34:33.960
The War Demons originally belonged to the divine race.

34:34.440 --> 34:35.480
Even living to a thousand years

34:35.480 --> 34:36.400
is no problem.

34:36.960 --> 34:38.670
But according to the current clan rules,

34:39.320 --> 34:40.840
women who can't bear children

34:41.230 --> 34:42.480
must be killed.

34:43.110 --> 34:44.280
Only through their death

34:44.670 --> 34:46.000
can they give more hope of life

34:46.000 --> 34:47.320
to the newborns.

34:49.320 --> 34:50.110
Ji Tanyin,

34:51.630 --> 34:52.880
they all say

34:53.760 --> 34:55.320
that to survive,

34:55.320 --> 34:56.960
sacrifices must be made.

34:57.230 --> 34:58.800
They say I'm wrong.

34:59.480 --> 35:00.440
Is that true?

35:01.230 --> 35:02.670
If you thought that way too,

35:03.230 --> 35:04.030
you wouldn't be

35:04.030 --> 35:05.440
suffering like this now.

35:06.030 --> 35:07.150
You don't have to force yourself

35:07.150 --> 35:08.840
to agree with others' opinions.

35:09.360 --> 35:10.320
You're still young.

35:10.760 --> 35:11.510
Don't trap yourself

35:11.510 --> 35:12.920
in hatred.

35:14.030 --> 35:14.840
But...

35:15.700 --> 35:17.420
the War Demons did become stronger

35:17.550 --> 35:19.110
through her methods.

35:19.320 --> 35:20.070
So, do you think

35:20.070 --> 35:21.440
this is sacrificing the less important

35:21.530 --> 35:22.610
for the greater good?

35:24.280 --> 35:25.230
Isn't it?

35:25.630 --> 35:26.800
Are you "the less important"?

35:27.590 --> 35:29.240
Who decided that you are "the less important"?

35:31.770 --> 35:32.960
What is "the less important"?

35:32.980 --> 35:34.140
And what is "the greater good"?

35:35.840 --> 35:36.630
Qian Lin,

35:36.880 --> 35:37.920
perhaps the individual

35:38.230 --> 35:39.760
should obey the collective.

35:40.030 --> 35:41.150
But the premise for obedience should be

35:41.150 --> 35:42.190
that the collective

35:42.190 --> 35:44.000
can better protect the individual.

35:44.840 --> 35:46.590
If the individual is already shattered,

35:47.320 --> 35:48.840
forever living in darkness

35:48.880 --> 35:50.440
and tragic despair,

35:50.840 --> 35:51.890
then such a collective

35:51.960 --> 35:53.360
no longer needs to exist

35:53.360 --> 35:54.730
or to be protected.

35:59.070 --> 36:00.840
You didn't do anything wrong.

36:02.800 --> 36:03.840
What about Yuanzhong?

36:04.800 --> 36:05.840
Did he do anything wrong?

36:44.640 --> 36:48.050
[Gold and Jade]

36:50.920 --> 36:51.710
Who are you?

36:52.880 --> 36:53.670
Thief!

36:54.070 --> 36:55.030
Catch the thief!

36:55.370 --> 36:56.330
Guards!

36:56.440 --> 36:57.510
Catch the thief!

37:35.030 --> 37:35.840
Xiu?

37:37.070 --> 37:38.110
Where's Ji Tanyin?

37:39.710 --> 37:40.390
She's gone.

37:48.150 --> 37:49.030
Where did she go?

37:50.480 --> 37:51.800
Why are you asking this?

37:53.920 --> 37:55.360
Which noble family did you rob

37:55.880 --> 37:57.110
to grow so tall?

37:57.410 --> 37:59.000
That family stole a child.

37:59.230 --> 38:00.670
They're not good people.

38:01.030 --> 38:02.670
Moreover, they're all going to die.

38:03.190 --> 38:04.070
What's the point

38:04.070 --> 38:05.070
of keeping their wealth?

38:07.630 --> 38:08.440
That makes sense.

38:10.150 --> 38:10.960
Let's drink.

38:11.480 --> 38:12.760
I can't eat anything else.

38:14.960 --> 38:15.760
That's true.

38:18.480 --> 38:19.440
It's a pity that Zi Fei and Kai Shan

38:19.440 --> 38:20.320
aren't here.

38:20.670 --> 38:22.030
There's no one here to drink with me.

38:24.960 --> 38:25.760
Yuanzhong,

38:26.440 --> 38:27.720
can you bear to part with Ji Tanyin?

38:35.710 --> 38:36.710
Whether I can bear it or not,

38:37.880 --> 38:39.110
what difference does it make?

38:39.710 --> 38:41.150
I don't know the real her,

38:42.070 --> 38:43.590
and she doesn't know the real me.

38:45.540 --> 38:46.980
If we were to be completely honest with each other,

38:47.840 --> 38:49.150
I'm afraid we'd immediately

38:49.400 --> 38:50.760
draw a line

38:51.480 --> 38:52.670
and go separate ways.

38:59.760 --> 39:00.840
Are you afraid?

39:03.960 --> 39:04.920
The five of us

39:05.000 --> 39:06.560
are the weapon spirits of the Divine Left Hand,

39:07.460 --> 39:09.270
formed by the primordial power,

39:09.880 --> 39:11.400
and created from the void.

39:11.710 --> 39:13.280
Our understanding of life and death

39:13.400 --> 39:14.440
is different from that

39:14.440 --> 39:15.480
of mortal beings.

39:16.030 --> 39:17.480
We coalesce because of you

39:17.630 --> 39:19.000
and dissipate because of you.

39:20.140 --> 39:22.430
So, when you hate,

39:23.000 --> 39:24.190
we hate;

39:24.670 --> 39:25.590
when you are afraid,

39:25.920 --> 39:27.110
we are afraid;

39:27.630 --> 39:28.630
when you hesitate,

39:29.110 --> 39:30.320
we hesitate;

39:30.440 --> 39:31.400
when you let go,

39:32.000 --> 39:33.190
we let go.

39:36.510 --> 39:38.110
So, Yuanzhong,

39:38.910 --> 39:39.510
why do I

39:39.510 --> 39:40.800
want to see Ji Tanyin so badly?

40:01.550 --> 40:02.400
Found it!

40:23.440 --> 40:24.920
Ling Yao's seal is about to be broken.

40:53.060 --> 40:54.560
♫Ask the heavens♫

40:54.580 --> 40:56.460
♫I don't know why I'm without a home♫

40:56.520 --> 40:57.760
♫I'm at a dead end♫

40:57.780 --> 40:59.580
♫And I have to surrender and accept my destiny♫

40:59.600 --> 41:01.330
♫I'm the wandering one♫

41:01.350 --> 41:03.150
♫My body and mind, falling into dust♫

41:03.180 --> 41:05.180
♫Only the moon in the sky♫

41:05.290 --> 41:06.700
♫Shines upon the lifelong decay♫

41:06.720 --> 41:08.830
♫The scars you can't see♫

41:08.850 --> 41:10.720
♫Are the proof of my struggle♫

41:10.760 --> 41:12.510
♫Be your own last straw of hope♫

41:12.540 --> 41:14.220
♫Why do you have to go alone?♫

41:14.240 --> 41:15.810
♫Let me learn to be fearless♫

41:15.830 --> 41:17.510
♫I live with no regrets♫

41:17.540 --> 41:18.900
♫Who deserves to be crushed?♫

41:18.930 --> 41:21.430
♫Don't tell me what's right or wrong♫

41:22.190 --> 41:24.200
♫I rebel against fate♫

41:25.010 --> 41:28.060
♫I'm willing to risk my life♫

41:28.670 --> 41:30.830
♫No matter how dangerous it is♫

41:31.140 --> 41:34.830
♫I will travel the world and scatter the fog♫

41:31.270 --> 41:32.660
Elder, this...

41:35.210 --> 41:37.980
♫The flowing water does not compete for the lead♫

41:38.350 --> 41:41.720
♫For millennia, all will turn to dust♫

41:42.190 --> 41:44.970
♫With our feet on the earth and the sky above♫

41:45.200 --> 41:48.730
♫We, the heroes of our time, are no ordinary beings♫

41:48.750 --> 41:51.550
♫The flowing water does not compete for the lead♫

41:51.040 --> 41:56.280
[Ningrui Pavilion]

41:51.810 --> 41:55.150
♫In my heart, there are no ripples, as if a god resides within♫

41:55.770 --> 41:58.650
♫I ride the wind and embrace the moon♫

41:58.750 --> 42:02.150
♫The raging river in my dreams has never ceased♫

42:01.590 --> 42:02.630
Could it be that Yuanzhong

42:03.000 --> 42:04.800
has broken all the seals of the weapon spirits?

42:06.420 --> 42:07.940
It's the primordial power.

42:10.400 --> 42:11.190
It seems

42:11.710 --> 42:13.590
that the High Priest of the Youhu Clan

42:13.670 --> 42:15.440
has broken all the seals

42:15.440 --> 42:16.670
of the Divine Left Hand.

42:16.850 --> 42:18.120
With Taihe not here,

42:18.280 --> 42:19.800
he is now the only one

42:19.800 --> 42:21.780
with the primordial power in the world.

42:22.480 --> 42:24.230
No one can lay a finger on him anymore.

42:25.000 --> 42:25.800
Not necessarily.

42:26.720 --> 42:27.830
Sixty years ago,

42:27.860 --> 42:29.650
he was as powerful as he is now,

42:30.150 --> 42:30.960
but in the end,

42:30.960 --> 42:32.590
he was tricked into sealing his power

42:32.590 --> 42:34.110
and became useless.

42:34.760 --> 42:36.030
Having the power alone,

42:36.060 --> 42:38.100
without the matching wisdom,

42:38.440 --> 42:39.670
he may not be able

42:39.710 --> 42:40.830
to hold onto this power.

42:47.020 --> 42:48.420
What I mean is that

42:48.760 --> 42:49.760
the primordial power

42:49.760 --> 42:51.450
is not that easy to control.

42:51.840 --> 42:53.480
Even someone as powerful as Deity Taihe

42:53.480 --> 42:54.880
was once harmed by a demon.

42:55.110 --> 42:56.360
If one is not steadfast enough,

42:56.470 --> 42:58.590
their power can instead become a curse.

42:58.830 --> 43:01.750
I hope he can use this power wisely

43:02.030 --> 43:04.000
and live out his life under the care

43:04.000 --> 43:05.290
of Goddess Wushuang,

43:05.480 --> 43:06.630
without wasting

43:07.130 --> 43:09.820
the opportunity we have given him.

43:27.030 --> 43:28.290
Why did the sky suddenly brighten?
